  },
  {
    title: "Practice Management Software",
    desc: "End-to-end practice management solutions including appointment scheduling, insurance claims processing, patient intake forms, automated reminders, payment collection, and reporting dashboards. Multi-location support with centralised administration and role-based access controls.",
